# Elite Kings County Ledger dbt Platform

A analytical data platform for the client Kings County. This repository combines a dbt project, Terraform-managed Snowflake provisioning, and CI automation to deliver a repeatable, production-oriented data platform for analytical workflows.

![Architecture Diagram](images/architecture.png)

## Overview

This project models a layered analytics architecture for a payments and subscriptions domain. It ingests raw data into a bronze landing area, transforms it into curated silver models, and produces business-facing gold dimension, fact, and mart tables for operational and executive analytics.

The repository includes:

- A dbt project for modeling and transformations
- Snowflake infrastructure-as-code using Terraform
- CI validation for SQL and Terraform changes
- A Docker-based execution path for running dbt in a consistent environment

## Business Context

The project is centered on merchant account, customer, payment intent, subscription, and payout data. It is designed to support use cases including:

- Merchant account intelligence
- Customer lifecycle tracking
- Payment performance monitoring
- Subscription health and churn analysis
- Payout reconciliation and operational oversight
- Executive reporting via business marts

